  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">223571_FY25_WFP_Zimbabwe_Buhera Lean Season Assistance (LSA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Goal: To improve access to food and ensure that vulnerable women, men and children consume adequate and nutritious diet .
 
 OUTCOME 1: Protected and/or improved access to food for 229,319 vulnerable community members in Buhera District from 24 November 2024 to 31 March 2025.
 
 OUTCOME 2: Increased household knowledge on livelihood activities, gender mainstreaming, nutrition, PSEA and environmental safeguarding. 
 
 OUTCOME 3: Strengthened and enhanced accountability towards stakeholders achieved and all other project processes allow for beneficiary dignity.</narrative>
  </description>
